+```
+
+### When blocked
+
+- Same tells as the search section.
+- After `search_mismatch` or `rate_not_available`, show the user what the subagent reported and get a new pick before dispatching again. After `hold_expired`, or once after `results_timeout`, resume the same subagent and have it start again from the property link with the same pick and guest details. After `sign_in_required`, offer the Non-Member Rate or the sign-in step. Only Access Denied or a captcha is a block: then, or after a site error, do not dispatch again;
